**Summary**

This is mimicking the way we allow usage for `highlight` and `snippet`.

**Result**

```js
  Instantsearch.widgets.hits({
    // ...
    templates: {
      item(hit) {
        return `
          <h2> ${hit.name} </h2>
          <button ${
            Instantsearch.insights('clickedObjectIDsAfterSearch', {
              eventName: "Add to favorite",
              objectIDs: [hit.objectID]
            })
          }>
            Add to favorite
          </button>
        `;
      },
    },
  });
```

